msgid "In the paths, {NET} is mainnet or testnet. Amounts are in duffs (1 DASH = 100,000,000 duffs) except Platform amounts, which are in credits (1 DASH = 100,000,000,000 credits). Times are unix seconds."
msgstr "Yollarda {NET}, mainnet veya testnet’tir. Tutarlar duff cinsindendir (1 DASH = 100.000.000 duff); yalnızca Platform tutarları kredi cinsindendir (1 DASH = 100.000.000.000 kredi). Zamanlar unix saniyesidir."

